    <tags>cydeep cybrium security cli rust cross-platform admin</tags>
    <summary>Purdue Level 0 visibility for S7, CIP, Modbus and BACnet</summary>
    <description>PLC and field asset deep inspection tool providing Purdue Level 0 visibility. Reads device identity and configuration over S7, CIP, Modbus and BACnet for inventory and posture assessment.

The Windows binary is Authenticode-signed by Cybrium Inc via Azure Trusted Signing. The install script downloads the release binary from GitHub, verifies its SHA-256 checksum, and refuses to install if the Authenticode signature is not valid. Verify after install with:

    Get-AuthenticodeSignature (Get-Command cydeep).Source
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cybrium-ai/cydeep/releases/tag/v0.1.6</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
  </files>
